{"id":"parks-alliance-public-space-grant","title":"The Parks Alliance public-space grant and its 31 sites","question":"How did City money reach the Parks Alliance for the Citywide Public Space Initiative sites, and which department paid?","finding":"The site layer lists 31 public spaces (15 labelled Rec and Park, the rest Public Works, transit, BART, Port, real-estate or private). Economic and Workforce Development paid the Alliance $4,472,507 under two grants titled 'Citywide Public Space' (FY2019-FY2023), the largest of its City funding lines; grant 1000013629 shows $4,083,416 agreed, $3,982,507 paid and $354,510 more committed, leaving the balance $253,601 below zero. Rec and Park itself paid the Alliance $861,436 of $19,782,241 in FY2019-FY2025.","how":"Vendor payments filtered to vendor SAN FRANCISCO PARKS ALLIANCE and summed by contract; contract terms from the supplier contracts file (prime rows).","limits":"A negative remaining balance is common for this department's grants (150 of 918 Economic and Workforce Development grants show one) and usually means an open commitment not yet closed out, not money paid twice. The site layer has no dates or amounts, so what was spent at each site is not in these records; the grant agreement and the Alliance's reports to the department would show it.","tier":"OFFICIAL","columns":[{"k":"contract","t":"Contract","type":"text"},{"k":"title","t":"Title","type":"text"},{"k":"dept","t":"Department","type":"text"},{"k":"paid","t":"Paid FY2019-FY2026","type":"usd"},{"k":"agreed","t":"Agreed","type":"usd"},{"k":"start","t":"Start","type":"date"},{"k":"end","t":"End","type":"date"}],"rows":[{"contract":"1000013629","title":"ECN Citywide Public Space Init","dept":"ECN Economic & Wrkfrce Dvlpmnt","paid":3982507,"agreed":4083416,"start":"2018-12-01","end":"2023-06-30"},{"contract":"1000024919","title":"ECN Shine On SF: Activation an","dept":"ECN Economic & Wrkfrce Dvlpmnt","paid":1249936,"agreed":1249936,"start":"2022-07-01","end":"20